msgstr "自制电源系绳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:7
#: 06abf572c32641c282fa61ce7c01399f a2b37765c3e44645b9c189c9facea201
#: bc566988ee714f9bb1e7f56f379b4a85 eae4ac59f66c49e0824e4464e30f637a
#: fc971abfa59f4695b7a4153c97d3a4d8
msgid ""
"For Maker-Faire 2017, the Cube Autopilot team needed a power tether for the "
"ArduCopter-following-ArduRover demonstration.  Plans to use a commercially-"
"available tether collapsed so Mr Challinger and Mr Wurzbach made a DIY "
"tether in just 24h."
msgstr ""
"为参加 2017 年 Maker Faire，Cube 飞控团队需要为「ArduCopter 跟随 "
"ArduRover」演示准备电源系绳。原计划使用商用系绳的方案落空，Mr Challinger 和 Mr Wurzbach 在 24 "
"小时内手工制作了一根 DIY 系绳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-power-tether.rst:11
#: 05869d838b05480684981a80915d63b3 0f870d9e8338478ab49b202c32e06b47
